flowchart TB
    A[Incoming Command] --> B[Compute Deterministic effectId]
    B --> C{processed_effects exists?}
    C -- COMMITTED --> D[NO_OP Receipt]
    C -- IN_PROGRESS --> E[Check Age / Reconcile]
    C -- FAILED --> F{Retry Budget Valid?}
    C -- No Record --> G[Insert IN_PROGRESS]
    G --> H[Call External System]
    H --> I[Mark COMMITTED or FAILED]
